{"id":"4ead54d85f5ad67d","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-addition-pr.md","title":"fact-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive","display":"fact-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-addition-pr","aliases":["92-fact-addition-pr"],"display":"fact-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-projection-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-addition-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-addition-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(+: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (addition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (successor function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1^1\">\\(P_1^1\\)</span> (unary projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n+\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(x+0=P_1^1(x)=x\\land x+S(y)=S(x+y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n+\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(x+0=P_1^1(x)=x\\land x+S(y)=S(x+y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\in\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(+\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>：二元加法是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>定义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x + 0 = P_1^1(x) = x\">\\(x + 0 = P_1^1(x) = x\\)</span></li>\n<li>递归步：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x + S(y) = S(x + y)\">\\(x + S(y) = S(x + y)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x, y, z) = S(z) = S \\circ P_3^3\">\\(h(x, y, z) = S(z) = S \\circ P_3^3\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>基函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1^1\">\\(P_1^1\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>都是PR</li>\n<li>原始递归运算保持PR</li>\n<li>因此加法是PR，在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P_1^1$ (unary projection, see [[92-df-projection-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"+: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"P_1^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n+\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(x+0=P_1^1(x)=x\\land x+S(y)=S(x+y)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"+\\in\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"x + 0 = P_1^1(x) = x","display":false},{"tex":"x + S(y) = S(x + y)","display":false},{"tex":"h(x, y, z) = S(z) = S \\circ P_3^3","display":false},{"tex":"P_1^1","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1400,"backlinks":[{"id":"9031faf8a1461cc3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-addition-pr]]"}],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","cc110e19a2eae4ea","fadfd5a594e57bef","a599a2f4a391801b"]}